WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.001
♪♪

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.794
Cherry:
I'm 23 years old.

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:04.338
♪♪

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:07.341
Cherry:
And I still don't understand
what it is that people do.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.675
What?

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.177
Just thinking that you're shady.

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:13.347
♪♪

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.348
(Gun shot)

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:15.432
It's a very epic film.

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.976
Antony Russo:
It spans 18 years of Cherry's
life.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:21.563
And it's ultimately a modern
tragic love story.

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:23.273
Cherry:
I take all the beautiful things
to heart.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.733
Cherry:
Until I about die from it.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:25.859
(Glass shattering)

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.277
Tom Holland: It's kind of 
a role of a lifetime.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:30.239
Tom Holland:
This character explores so many
different avenues of life.

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:31.990
Ciara Bravo:
You have a romantic film, that
leads

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:32.991
into a war film,

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.160
Ciara Bravo:
that leads to a drug film.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.121
Cherry:
Sometimes I feel like I've
already seen everything that's gonna happen.

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.998
♪♪

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:41.500
Cherry:
And it's a nightmare.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.169
We have a very passionate
connection to our hometown of
Cleveland.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:46.588
Joe Russo:
And the locations of the book
were specific

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.215
to areas that Anth and I grew up
in.

00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:49.216
♪♪

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:51.009
Joe Russo:
We had very similar upbringings

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.136
Joe Russo:
with extremely different
outcomes.

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:54.846
The City is really a character.

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:58.475
So what makes a joker like you
wanna join the United States
Army for?

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.061
Sense of purpose.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.062
(Thud) 

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.772
(Explosions) (Automatic gunfire)

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:06.817
We wanted to try to convey as
best as we could,

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:09.403
Anthony Russo:
the experience of being in Iraq.

00:01:09.403 --> 00:01:13.490
With Joe and Anthony, they're
constantly pushing to go the
extra mile.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:16.868
Joe Russo:
We made a decision to sit in
longer takes with him.

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:20.330
Joe Russo:
Sitting with someone who is ill
prepared for death and destruction

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.250
Joe Russo:
on a scale, uh, that he's never
seen before.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.627
(Explosions)

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:26.795
♪♪

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:28.297
There's so many moving parts.

00:01:28.297 --> 00:01:30.841
Tom Holland:
We're so lucky, we've got the
crew to be able to put moving parts

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:31.883
Tom Holland:
in the right place.

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:34.052
Newton Sigel:
Prepping this movie, we talked
about it as Jazz.

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:36.054
there's a huge process of
discovery.

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:40.559
We're always trying to find the
magic with any scene that really
brings the story out.

00:01:40.559 --> 00:01:41.560
(Gunshot)

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:45.063
Working with the Russo brothers,
has been one of the best
experiences of my life.

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:49.067
Everything about this film. The
stars have just aligned and it's
just been such a wonderful time.

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:51.069
Tom Holland:
And a lot of that is down to the
way

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:52.779
Tom Holland:
the Russo's hold themselves on
set.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:56.616
We love this idea of sharing
the experience with everyone

00:01:56.616 --> 00:02:00.078
Joe Russo:
and this entire group produced
something I think that we're all very proud of.

00:02:00.078 --> 00:02:06.543
♪♪

